## Phase 2 — Split DeltaFlatStore into materialized + virtual stores

### Context
With the two hats in place, `DeltaFlatStore` (used both as a `table`/CTAS copy
and as a no-copy `engine="view"` pass-through) is split into two concrete
classes on the correct hats, sharing one read mixin. Behavior-identical; the
companion behaviour is preserved as an option (search-cache setting) on both
stores — the split is about the write/build/sync surface only.

### Changes
1. `src/back/core/graphdb/delta/DeltaReadStore.py` (new): plain mixin holding the
   full SQL **read** surface shared by both Delta stores — connection/FQN
   resolution, `query_triples`/`count_triples`, companion read accessors
   (`adjacency_table_ids`, `entity_search_table_id(_asserted)`, `props_table_id`,
   `synced_table_name`), stats (`get_aggregate_stats`,
   `get_type/predicate_distribution`), status probes, `execute_query`, and
   `expand_and_fetch_subgraph`.
2. `src/back/core/graphdb/delta/DeltaMaterializedStore.py` (renamed from
   `DeltaFlatStore.py`, rewritten): `DeltaMaterializedStore(DeltaReadStore,
   MaterializedGraphBackend)` — keeps only the write/build surface (table
   lifecycle, triple ingestion, companion rebuild, inference purge, OPTIMIZE).
   `supports_materialized_inference_purge/adjacency/entity_search/props = True`.
3. `src/back/core/graphdb/delta/DeltaViewStore.py` (new):
   `DeltaViewStore(DeltaReadStore, VirtualBackend)` — the no-copy `engine="view"`
   store. Keeps `supports_adjacency/entity_search/props = True` (companions a
   build pipeline materialized next to the live relation stay readable, governed
   by the search-cache option); `supports_materialized_inference_purge = False`.
4. `src/back/core/graphdb/delta/__init__.py`: export `DeltaReadStore`,
   `DeltaMaterializedStore`, `DeltaViewStore` (dropped `DeltaFlatStore`).
5. `src/back/core/graphdb/GraphDBFactory.py`: `_create_delta` →
   `DeltaMaterializedStore`, `_create_delta_view` → `DeltaViewStore`.
6. Repointed the remaining `src/` consumers:
   `src/back/objects/simulation/Sandbox.py` (sandbox store →
   `DeltaMaterializedStore`, isinstance → `DeltaReadStore`),
   `src/back/core/reasoning/ReasoningService.py` (materialize path →
   `DeltaMaterializedStore`),
   `src/back/core/graphdb/delta/health.py` (`probe_table_status` type →
   `DeltaReadStore`, `probe_from_client` → `DeltaViewStore`),
   `src/back/core/graphdb/delta/DeltaTripleStoreBuildPipeline.py`
   (cache rebuild store → `DeltaMaterializedStore`),
   `src/back/core/databricks/SQLWarehouse.py` (docstring).
7. Architecture baseline: moved the oversized-function key
   `delta/DeltaFlatStore.py::DeltaFlatStore.expand_and_fetch_subgraph` →
   `delta/DeltaReadStore.py::DeltaReadStore.expand_and_fetch_subgraph` (114).
8. Tests: routed `engine="view"` patch targets to `DeltaViewStore` and the OBO
   `engine="delta"` path to `DeltaMaterializedStore`; repointed the remaining
   materialized-path test imports/patches/constructions
   (`test_triplestore_factory.py`, `test_obo_backends.py`,
   `test_sql_literal_escaping.py`, `test_materialized_inference_purge.py`,
   `test_delta_status_probe.py`, `test_delta_overview_stats.py`,
   `test_delta_flat_store.py`, `test_delta_build_pipeline.py`,
   `test_graph_query_bounds.py`, `test_graphdb_factory_delta.py`).
9. Corrected the design spec and the Phase 1 changelog note: `VirtualBackend`
   does not hard-disable companion flags — companions are preserved as an option.

